5. Corollary 9.1: average of (g x)(g y)^T over a finite irreducible subgroup (= Haar average for a quadratic)
   O (24 rotations, subgroup of SO(3)): max|avg - <x,y>/3 I| = 2.2e-16
   O_h (48, subgroup of O(3)): max|avg - <x,y>/3 I| = 3.3e-16
   Monte Carlo Haar SO(3), 2e5 samples: max|avg - <x,y>/3 I| = 1.7e-03
   (second moments are invariant under an independent reflection of each state: for SO(3) data the
    handedness of the states is NOT determined by the second moment)
